      "npc" : "Shenime",
      "text" : "[Shenime]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 100,
      "npc" : "Shenime",
      "text" : "Oh, what's going on here?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 101,
      "npc" : "Shenime",
      "text" : "They destroyed additional troops that Mayor sent?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 103,
      "npc" : "Shenime",
      "text" : "What...?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 103,
      "npc" : "Shenime",
      "text" : "I fought monsters off!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 104,
      "npc" : "Shenime",
      "text" : "[Shenime]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 105,
      "npc" : "Shenime",
      "text" : "It doesn't matter."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 106,
      "npc" : "Shenime",
      "text" : "Your job ends here."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 107,
      "npc" : "Shenime",
      "text" : "Now you became a betrayer."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 108,
      "npc" : "Shenime",
      "text" : "Farewell, then!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 111,
      "npc" : "Shenime",
      "placeholders" : [
        "strcharinfo(0)"
      ],
      "text" : "[{0}]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 112,
      "npc" : "Shenime",
      "text" : "No...way!!!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 177,
      "text" : "Upon eliminating the intruders near the Orb, another strange-looking creatures appeared."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 179,
      "text" : "We couldn't communicate with them either, and one of them seemed furious after looking around and finding out that its fellows are defeated."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 181,
      "placeholders" : [
        "strcharinfo(0)"
      ],
      "text" : "[{0}]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 182,
      "text" : "They look as if they are incarnation of Morocc."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 183,
      "text" : "Is the King of Domons after the Orb?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 184,
      "text" : "Or is it just a coincidence?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 186,
      "text" : "[Subordinate of the King of Demons]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 187,
      "text" : "Kyaarr...Keraahhh!!!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 188,
      "text" : "Kkwaaa!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 190,
      "text" : "A battle cannot be avoided!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 191,
      "text" : "They will kill me!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 221,
      "text" : "An empty room with nothing inside."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 222,
      "text" : "a light is coming out of a circular equipment in the middle of the room."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 224,
      "text" : "[Suspicious Creature]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 225,
      "text" : "Keheehehehe......"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 227,
      "text" : "A group of unidentifiable creatures is approaching threateningly."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 228,
      "text" : "They seemed surprised, and although Bifrost's will still holds, it's hard to communicate."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 230,
      "text" : "[Suspicious Creature]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 231,
      "text" : "Kyaarr...Ke...Keryarya!!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 233,
      "text" : "It seems like they are going to start attacking any minute."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 234,
      "text" : "We cannot help fighting them!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 260,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "[Avant]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 261,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "Hey, look who's here!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 262,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "You're a friend of my son, right?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 263,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "What a strange chance it is that has brought us together here!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 266,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "[Avant]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 267,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "Did something happen to you?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 268,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "There was a subtle and magical echo to it."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 269,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "Immediately after that, you were thrown here."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 271,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "It's all because of you!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 271,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "Shenime said..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 272,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "[Avant]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 273,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "I don't understand a word you're saying."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 274,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "Can't you organize your story? Don't you know 'five W's and one H' rule?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 277,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "[Avant]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 278,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "Ooh...so that's what happened."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 279,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "So you're saying that Shenime was after the Orb?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 281,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "[Avant]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 282,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "hehehe...hahahhaha ahahahahha"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 283,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "Well, well...did he get me, too?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 284,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "Me, Avant, of all the people?! Hahahaha!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 287,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "What do you mean?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 288,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "[Avant]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 289,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "I was doing a research on the power of the Orb on my own."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 290,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "But Shenime just urged me persistently."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 293,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "[Avant]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 294,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "I started from thinking about the beauty of the Orb and went on to wondering what kind of power is accumulated inside the Orb..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 295,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "and I started questioning the principle of the Orb's power since we all benefit from it."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 297,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "[Avant]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 298,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "All Laphines think of the Orb as something natural as air and water, but he was the first one to make me perceive it differently and investigate its origin."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 299,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "Right...Shenime. He excited my curiosity on purpose."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 301,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "[Avant]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 302,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "Stimulate a person who wasn't aware of air and water, and make him recognize and carry on investigating!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 303,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "Well, well...isn't that interesting!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 306,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "[Avant]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 307,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "Ha...hahaha..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 308,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "...I'm so angry about the fact that I just realized how he used me, but what's even worse is that I've done something horrible to our people."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 309,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "I think I'm pretty irritated now."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 311,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "You had a conscience?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 312,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "[Avant]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 313,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "What kind of a person do you think I am, seriously!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 314,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "Is it because of my sons?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 315,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "Well, then, I can't blame you too much."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 318,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "[Avant]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 319,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "...Bah."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 320,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "It's no fun."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 321,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "It's not fun anymore. I'm no longer interested in you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 323,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "[Avant]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 324,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "......"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 325,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "Seems like there's a visitor."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 328,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "[Minuel]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 329,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "placeholders" : [
        "strcharinfo(0)"
      ],
      "text" : "{0}Sir,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 330,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "Although you're detained on suspicion of being responsible for the recent incident in the lighting room,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 331,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "there are some witnesses to prove your innocence."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 333,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "[Minuel]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 334,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "I don't know the details,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 335,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "but I also believe you're not guilty."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 336,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "I'll move you to the treatment room since this seems like a severe wound."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 338,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "[Minuel]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 339,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "I don't think it's a big deal."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 340,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "...hopefully."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 341,
      "npc" : "Avant",
      "text" : "Let's go. I'll guide you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 349,
      "npc" : "Loki",
      "text" : "[Loki]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 350,
      "npc" : "Loki",
      "text" : "It seems like this guy next to me has a lot more to say than I do."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 351,
      "npc" : "Loki",
      "text" : "Why don't you explain to him first?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 356,
      "npc" : "Nydhog",
      "text" : "[Guardian Nydhog]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 357,
      "npc" : "Nydhog",
      "text" : "I think you should talk to Hisie first."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 363,
      "npc" : "Hisie",
      "text" : "[Hisie]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 364,
      "npc" : "Hisie",
      "text" : "Can you tell me exactly what happened?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 366,
      "npc" : "Hisie",
      "text" : "I fought with monsters."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 368,
      "npc" : "Hisie",
      "text" : "[Hisie]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 369,
      "npc" : "Hisie",
      "text" : "Monsters? Subordinates of Morocc?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 370,
      "npc" : "Hisie",
      "text" : "What you were trying to kill were our soldiers, the Laphines!!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 371,
      "npc" : "Hisie",
      "text" : "What on earth happened there?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 375,
      "npc" : "Hisie",
      "text" : "[Loki]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 376,
      "npc" : "Hisie",
      "text" : "It's because of this."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 377,
      "npc" : "Hisie",
      "placeholders" : [
        "strcharinfo(0)"
      ],
      "text" : "{0}It was inside the body of -"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 378,
      "npc" : "Hisie",
      "text" : "This is how powerful Shenime is."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 380,
      "npc" : "Hisie",
      "text" : "On Loki's palm, there rested a small, thin, and dried piece of thorn."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 383,
      "npc" : "Hisie",
      "text" : "[Hisie]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 384,
      "npc" : "Hisie",
      "text" : "Shenime, the Chief of Staff?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 385,
      "npc" : "Hisie",
      "text" : "Why is he related to this?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 389,
      "npc" : "Hisie",
      "text" : "[Loki]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 390,
      "npc" : "Hisie",
      "text" : "Shenime is one of the subordinates of Morocc."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 391,
      "npc" : "Hisie",
      "text" : "His power enbales him to control another person directly or mentally influence that person indirectly through a part of his body."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 393,
      "npc" : "Hisie",
      "text" : "Now that I think about it..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 394,
      "npc" : "Hisie",
      "placeholders" : [
        "strcharinfo(0)"
      ],
      "text" : "[{0}]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 395,
      "npc" : "Hisie",
      "text" : "Right before coming here, Shenime reached his hand out to me and I felt a spark when I held his hand."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 396,
      "npc" : "Hisie",
      "text" : "I thought it was just my imagination and ignored it...maybe that's when he..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 398,
      "npc" : "Hisie",
      "text" : "[Nydhog]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 399,
      "npc" : "Hisie",
      "text" : "You're probably right."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 400,
      "npc" : "Hisie",
      "text" : "They use wicked tricks."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 401,
      "npc" : "Hisie",
      "text" : "This thorn here probably has clouded your judgement."
    },
