      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 404,
      "npc" : "Hisie",
      "text" : "[Hisie]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 405,
      "npc" : "Hisie",
      "text" : "So you're saying that he deceived us all?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 406,
      "npc" : "Hisie",
      "text" : "The Chief of Staff is a Laphine who stayed with us for a long time! He can't be..."
